Nivel de vechime: Asociat
Tip de angajare: Full-time
Sectoare de activitate: Servicii IT și consultanță IT
Who we are: 
 Open-minded intellectuals who embrace emerging technologies on our mission to create innovative Software Engineering Solutions that will impact millions of users around the world.
 We are looking for: 
 Embedded Software Tester who will contribute to the verification and test activities for Distributed Control Architecture (DCA) product in a safety critical context for railway interlocking solutions.
 This is a great opportunity to work with highly reliable software in a multinational environment .
 What you will do: 
Specification of Test Cases on Requirements basis (including performance and boundary tests);
Implementation of Test Cases for software-software and software-hardware integration tests;
Ability to test case design, test automation and test execution;
Preparation of test campaigns with functional tests and non-regression tests;
Detailed description of reproduction scenario when finding bugs;
Evaluation of the test output (coverage, traceability, progress);
Test documentation;
Test environment maintainability;
Project monitoring (ex: monitoring of non-conformities correction, test result reporting);
Prepare the hardware and software configuration for testing activities;
 What you must have: 
You are studying Computer Science or a similar technical domain;
You have basic OOP knowledge;
Knowledge of computer networks and operating systems fundamentals;
Basic knowledge of Linux;
You are committed to the highest levels of quality;
Knowledge of version control systems (Git, ClearCase, etc.);
Experience with real-time or safety-critical systems.
 What's in it for you: 
Extended compensation and benefits package.
Continuous learning opportunities to enhance your professional and soft skills.
A great working environment with people who put their heart, mind, and soul into everything they do and understand the importance of team spirit.
 We really welcome open-minded and committed people: 
Eager to take on new challenges and learn new things;
Who put their heart, mind, and soul into everything they do;
Who enjoy sharing knowledge and understand the importance of team spirit.
 ***Only eligible candidates will be contacted to move forward in the recruitment process. 
